1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:07,030
Besides the Account Statement, Reports has Trading Statistics.

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:10,720
Choose a period, for example Year.

3
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:19,160
Click Run Report.

4
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:24,020
Profit, trade count, lots and trade times, for winning, losing and even trades.

5
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:34,190
The arrows go back and forward, as in a web browser.

6
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:39,750
The circular arrow reloads the page.

